{
  "uid": "arhugula-genai",
  "title": "Arhugula · LLM calls",
  "tags": [
    "arhugula"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "label": "Project",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "tempo",
          "uid": "tempo"
        },
        "description": "The project (resource attribute service.namespace) whose traces the panels read.",
        "query": {
          "refId": "TempoDatasourceVariableQueryEditor-VariableQuery",
          "type": 1,
          "label": "service.namespace"
        },
        "definition": "",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [],
        "regex": "",
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "arhugula"
      ],
      "title": "Arhugula dashboards",
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true,
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "description": "Explains what this dashboard or section shows.",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Answers:** how many LLM calls ran, how fast, on which provider and model, how many tokens they used, and which calls failed.\n\n**Data comes from:** every workflow step that dispatches to a model. Each dispatch writes one `chat <model>` span. Runs on any provider produce data; token counts appear only for API-metered providers and Ollama, while subscription CLI routes (`claude_code`, `codex`, `gemini`, `antigravity`) report tokens as `external_cli.usage.*` evidence instead.\n\nThe stack keeps traces for 24 hours, so no panel can look further back than that."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM calls",
      "description": "How many LLM calls ran in the selected time range?",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.namespace =~ \"$namespace\" && name =~ \"chat .*\" } | count_over_time()",
          "filters": [],
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 2,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 4
      }
    },
